      "type": "event",
      "excerpt": "Come along for a musical journey with the delectable cabaret husband-and-wife duo, Dawn and Eric Spitz, and their friends: classically trained soprano Brett…",
      "text": "Come along for a musical journey with the delectable cabaret husband-and-wife duo, Dawn and Eric Spitz, and their friends: classically trained soprano Brett…\n\nLearning\n\nAfternoon Concert: Four for a Song\n\nCome along for a musical journey with the delectable cabaret husband-and-wife duo, Dawn and Eric Spitz, and their friends: classically trained soprano Brett…\n\nAbout this event\n\nCome along for a musical journey with the delectable cabaret husband-and-wife duo, Dawn and Eric Spitz, and their friends: classically trained soprano Brett Kroeger and magnificent pianist Tom Cuffari. A show for all generations you do not want to miss! Brett Kroeger also performs two arias from La Boh&egrave;me, along with many other beloved Broadway favorites. Check the library page for registration, tickets, and any schedule updates.\n\nAt a Glance\n\nStatus\n\nPast\n\nDate\n\nThursday, August 13, 2026\n\nTime\n\n2:00 PM - 3:00 PM\n\nLocation\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nAddress\n\n100 Martine Avenue, White Plains, NY 10601\n\nSource\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nMore Events\n\nRelated events\n\nWestchester During the Revolutionary War (History via Igloo)\n\nJul 15, 2026\n\nLearn about Westchester County during the Revolutionary War and what happened throughout the conflict.\n\nComité Noviembre: Reception\n\nJul 16, 2026\n\nThe evening will feature an intimate discussion with Chairwoman Teresa Santiago, accompanied by featured artists, music, light bites, and refreshments.\n\nMusical BINGO: A Self-Care Sound Session\n\nJul 26, 2026\n\nJoin us for the ultimate stress relief at our 90s & 2000s Musical Bingo event!"
