      "url": "/events/library-clean-energy-workforce-opportuntiy-2026-10-06/",
      "type": "event",
      "excerpt": "Sustainable Westchester, in partnership with Healthy Home Academy, is offering a FREE 5-week Clean Energy Workforce Training program.",
      "text": "Sustainable Westchester, in partnership with Healthy Home Academy, is offering a FREE 5-week Clean Energy Workforce Training program.\n\nWorkshop\n\nClean Energy Workforce Opportuntiy\n\nSustainable Westchester, in partnership with Healthy Home Academy, is offering a FREE 5-week Clean Energy Workforce Training program.\n\nAbout this event\n\nSustainable Westchester, in partnership with Healthy Home Academy, is offering a FREE 5-week Clean Energy Workforce Training program. No experience is required. Participants receive hands-on training, stipends, and job placement support for careers in heat pumps and home performance. This is a great opportunity to gain skills in a growing industry and start a meaningful new career. Learn more and apply here: Heat Pump Career Training Program or Home Performance Career Training Program. Check the library page for registration, tickets, and any schedule updates.\n\nAt a Glance\n\nStatus\n\nUpcoming\n\nDate\n\nTuesday, October 6, 2026\n\nTime\n\n2:00 PM - 3:00 PM\n\nLocation\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nAddress\n\n100 Martine Avenue, White Plains, NY 10601\n\nSource\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nMore Events\n\nRelated events\n\nPowerful Public Speaking & Presentation Skills\n\nSep 15, 2026\n\nWe will be hosting the following program in partnership with The College of Westchester.\n\nFinding the Best College Fit\n\nSep 21, 2026\n\nThere are over 2,000 four-year colleges in the United States for students to consider.\n\nVirtual Clean Energy Workforce Opportuntiy\n\nOct 14, 2026\n\nSustainable Westchester, in partnership with Healthy Home Academy, is offering a FREE 5-week Clean Energy Workforce Training program."
