      "url": "/events/library-cooking-up-community-2026-07-22/",
      "type": "event",
      "excerpt": "Join Chef Giovanni Green of Break Bread not Hearts for four days of healthy AND delicious cooking!",
      "text": "Join Chef Giovanni Green of Break Bread not Hearts for four days of healthy AND delicious cooking!\n\nLearning\n\nCooking Up Community\n\nJoin Chef Giovanni Green of Break Bread not Hearts for four days of healthy AND delicious cooking!\n\nAbout this event\n\nJoin Chef Giovanni Green of Break Bread not Hearts for four days of healthy AND delicious cooking! The culinary lessons will build our knowledge of where our food comes from, what it does for our bodies, and how we are all connected as a community. Food is the common denominator and Love is the main ingredient. This series is for teens in grades 7-12 (as of fall 2026). Join us for one or all; register separately for each day you plan to attend. This program is made possible through the generous support of New York-Presbyterian. Check the library page for registration, tickets, and any schedule updates.\n\nAt a Glance\n\nStatus\n\nPast\n\nDate\n\nWednesday, July 22, 2026\n\nTime\n\n11:00 AM - 12:30 PM\n\nLocation\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nAddress\n\n100 Martine Avenue, White Plains, NY 10601\n\nSource\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nMore Events\n\nRelated events\n\nCooking Up Community\n\nJul 23, 2026\n\nJoin Chef Giovanni Green of Break Bread not Hearts for four days of healthy AND delicious cooking!\n\nEarth, Wind, Fire and Zombies!\n\nAug 11, 2026\n\nSurvive the zombie apocalypse with Zach Jones of Our Elements Outdoor Learning, a nature-based outdoor education organization rooted in the Hudson Valley.\n\nEarth, Wind, Fire and Zombies!\n\nAug 12, 2026\n\nSurvive the zombie apocalypse with Zach Jones of Our Elements Outdoor Learning, a nature-based outdoor education organization rooted in the Hudson Valley."
