      "id": "page:/events/library-creative-upcycling-the-junk-journal-workshop-2026-10-19/",
      "sourceId": "page:/events/library-creative-upcycling-the-junk-journal-workshop-2026-10-19/",
      "title": "Creative Upcycling: The Junk Journal Workshop",
      "url": "/events/library-creative-upcycling-the-junk-journal-workshop-2026-10-19/",
      "type": "event",
      "excerpt": "Discover the art of junk journaling!",
      "text": "Discover the art of junk journaling!\n\nWorkshop\n\nCreative Upcycling: The Junk Journal Workshop\n\nDiscover the art of junk journaling!\n\nAbout this event\n\nDiscover the art of junk journaling! In this hands-on workshop, we'll turn everyday paper \"junk\"-like old book pages, ticket stubs, maps, wrapping paper, and packaging-into a beautiful, highly personalized scrapbook. Whether you want to document your daily life, create a unique sketchbook, or just enjoy a relaxing craft, junk journaling is the perfect, pressure-free way to express yourself. No prior crafting or artistic experience is needed! We will provide a starter kit of papers, ribbons, and embellishments, but feel free to bring any personal scraps, photos, or flat keepsakes you'd like to include. Check out the full lineup of sewing and crafting classes here! Check the library page for registration, tickets, and any schedule updates.\n\nAt a Glance\n\nStatus\n\nUpcoming\n\nDate\n\nMonday, October 19, 2026\n\nTime\n\n6:00 PM - 7:30 PM\n\nLocation\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nAddress\n\n100 Martine Avenue, White Plains, NY 10601\n\nSource\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nMore Events\n\nRelated events\n\nIntroduction to Drawing\n\nJul 15, 2026\n\nLearn to draw step by step Program will be hosted by Lila from The Kraft Dealer.\n\nIntroduction to Drawing\n\nJul 18, 2026\n\nLearn to draw step by step Program will be hosted by Lila from The Kraft Dealer.\n\nIntroduction to Drawing\n\nAug 2, 2026\n\nLearn to draw step by step Program will be hosted by Lila from The Kraft Dealer."
