      "text": "Google Sheets is a free online spreadsheet program.\n\nLearning\n\nIntro to Google Sheets, Part 1\n\nGoogle Sheets is a free online spreadsheet program.\n\nAbout this event\n\nGoogle Sheets is a free online spreadsheet program. Anyone with a Google account and Internet access can use it. The spreadsheets you create are automatically saved by Google in the cloud. In this class we will learn to create a simple spreadsheet and chart. Participants must have a Gmail account and know their username and password. Check the library page for registration, tickets, and any schedule updates.\n\nAt a Glance\n\nStatus\n\nUpcoming\n\nDate\n\nTuesday, September 8, 2026\n\nTime\n\n4:00 PM - 5:15 PM\n\nLocation\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nAddress\n\n100 Martine Avenue, White Plains, NY 10601\n\nSource\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nMore Events\n\nRelated events\n\nIntro to Google Sheets, Part 2\n\nSep 15, 2026\n\nLearn to use the fill handle, the IF function and conditional formatting in Google Sheets.\n\nWestchester During the Revolutionary War (History via Igloo)\n\nSep 17, 2026\n\nLearn about Westchester County during the Revolutionary War and what happened throughout the conflict.\n\nLearn about 3D Printing (in the Igloo)\n\nSep 24, 2026\n\nLearn about 3D printing and how to use the Library's 3D printing services."
