      "id": "page:/events/library-women-s-empowerment-hour-2026-08-26/",
      "sourceId": "page:/events/library-women-s-empowerment-hour-2026-08-26/",
      "title": "Women&#39;s Empowerment Hour",
      "url": "/events/library-women-s-empowerment-hour-2026-08-26/",
      "type": "event",
      "excerpt": "Women&#39;s Empowerment Hour is a special time for women of the community to come together, connect, and lift each other up.",
      "text": "Women&#39;s Empowerment Hour is a special time for women of the community to come together, connect, and lift each other up.\n\nWorkshop\n\nWomen's Empowerment Hour\n\nWomen's Empowerment Hour is a special time for women of the community to come together, connect, and lift each other up.\n\nAbout this event\n\nWomen's Empowerment Hour is a special time for women of the community to come together, connect, and lift each other up. It's a space to share real experiences, celebrate our wins, and encourage one another through life's challenges. During this workshop we will focus on financial tips we can use as we transition into Fall 2026. End the summer strong and come learn how you can prepare mentally for a new season. Walk-ins are welcomed, we hope to see you soon! This program is hosted by Sister's Village E4th, a collaboration between the YWCA White Plains and Central Westchester, Women's Mentoring Network, and the Westchester Office for Women. Check the library page for registration, tickets, and any schedule updates.\n\nAt a Glance\n\nStatus\n\nPast\n\nDate\n\nWednesday, August 26, 2026\n\nTime\n\n12:00 PM - 1:00 PM\n\nLocation\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nAddress\n\n100 Martine Avenue, White Plains, NY 10601\n\nSource\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nMore Events\n\nRelated events\n\nDigital Decluttering\n\nJul 8, 2026\n\nIn this workshop, we'll slow down and actually understand why digital chaos builds up - and what to do about it.\n\nUnearth a Story\n\nJul 14, 2026\n\nJoin us for Unearth a Story, a generative writing workshop designed to help participants uncover the stories inside you!\n\nIntroduction to Drawing\n\nJul 15, 2026\n\nLearn to draw step by step Program will be hosted by Lila from The Kraft Dealer."
