      "text": "Andrew Lloyd Webber’s School of Rock: Young Actors Edition is a dynamic, one-hour version of the musical based on the hit movie.\n\nArts\n\nSchool Of Rock: Young Actors\n\nAndrew Lloyd Webber’s School of Rock: Young Actors Edition is a dynamic, one-hour version of the musical based on the hit movie.\n\nAbout this event\n\nAndrew Lloyd Webber’s School of Rock: Young Actors Edition is a dynamic, one-hour version of the musical based on the hit movie. The tuner follows Dewey Finn, a failed, wannabe rock star who decides to earn an extra bit of cash by posing as a substitute teacher at a prestigious prep school. There he turns a class of straight-A pupils into a guitar-shredding, bass-slapping, mind-blowing rock band. But can he get them to the Battle of the Bands without their parents and the school’s headmistress finding out? Please note this version of the show does NOT require any of the actors to play instruments. $23 Use the show page for tickets and the full performance schedule.\n\nAt a Glance\n\nStatus\n\nPast\n\nDate\n\nMonday, July 20, 2026 to August 8, 2026\n\nTime\n\nSee details\n\nLocation\n\nWhite Plains Performing Arts Center\n\nAddress\n\n11 City Place, 3rd Floor, White Plains, NY 10601\n\nSource\n\nWhite Plains Performing Arts Center\n\nMore Events\n\nRelated events\n\nAnastasia: Youth Edition\n\nJun 29, 2026 - Jul 18, 2026\n\nAnastasia: The Musical is the spectacular new musical about discovering who you are and defining who you’re meant to be.\n\nShrek Kids\n\nAug 24, 2026 - Aug 28, 2026\n\nBeauty is in the eye of the ogre in Shrek The Musical KIDS, based on the Oscar-winning Dream Works Animation film and fantastic Broadway musical.\n\nCatch Me If You Can\n\nApr 10, 2026 - May 3, 2026\n\nA spring run of the musical at the White Plains Performing Arts Center."
