      "text": "Beauty is in the eye of the ogre in Shrek The Musical KIDS, based on the Oscar-winning Dream Works Animation film and fantastic Broadway musical.\n\nArts\n\nShrek Kids\n\nBeauty is in the eye of the ogre in Shrek The Musical KIDS, based on the Oscar-winning Dream Works Animation film and fantastic Broadway musical.\n\nAbout this event\n\nBeauty is in the eye of the ogre in Shrek The Musical KIDS, based on the Oscar-winning Dream Works Animation film and fantastic Broadway musical. It’s a “big bright beautiful world” as everyone’s favorite ogre, Shrek, leads a cast of fairytale misfits on an adventure to rescue a princess and find true acceptance. Part romance and part twisted fairy tale, Shrek KIDS is an irreverently fun show with a powerful message for the whole family. $16 Use the show page for tickets and the full performance schedule.\n\nAt a Glance\n\nStatus\n\nPast\n\nDate\n\nMonday, August 24, 2026 to August 28, 2026\n\nTime\n\nSee details\n\nLocation\n\nWhite Plains Performing Arts Center\n\nAddress\n\n11 City Place, 3rd Floor, White Plains, NY 10601\n\nSource\n\nWhite Plains Performing Arts Center\n\nMore Events\n\nRelated events\n\nAnastasia: Youth Edition\n\nJun 29, 2026 - Jul 18, 2026\n\nAnastasia: The Musical is the spectacular new musical about discovering who you are and defining who you’re meant to be.\n\nSchool Of Rock: Young Actors\n\nJul 20, 2026 - Aug 8, 2026\n\nAndrew Lloyd Webber’s School of Rock: Young Actors Edition is a dynamic, one-hour version of the musical based on the hit movie.\n\nCatch Me If You Can\n\nApr 10, 2026 - May 3, 2026\n\nA spring run of the musical at the White Plains Performing Arts Center."
