      "text": "Trolls JR. is based on the irreverent Dream Works Animation movie franchise and features a colorful, wondrous world populated by hilariously unforgettable…\n\nArts\n\nTrolls Jr.\n\nTrolls JR. is based on the irreverent Dream Works Animation movie franchise and features a colorful, wondrous world populated by hilariously unforgettable…\n\nAbout this event\n\nTrolls JR. is based on the irreverent Dream Works Animation movie franchise and features a colorful, wondrous world populated by hilariously unforgettable characters. The show follows the overly optimistic Trolls, constantly with a song on their lips, and the comically pessimistic Bergens, who are only happy when they have Trolls in their stomach. $23 Use the show page for tickets and the full performance schedule.\n\nAt a Glance\n\nStatus\n\nPast\n\nDate\n\nMonday, August 10, 2026 to August 22, 2026\n\nTime\n\nSee details\n\nLocation\n\nWhite Plains Performing Arts Center\n\nAddress\n\n11 City Place, 3rd Floor, White Plains, NY 10601\n\nSource\n\nWhite Plains Performing Arts Center\n\nMore Events\n\nRelated events\n\nCatch Me If You Can\n\nApr 10, 2026 - May 3, 2026\n\nA spring run of the musical at the White Plains Performing Arts Center.\n\nAnastasia: Youth Edition\n\nJun 29, 2026 - Jul 18, 2026\n\nAnastasia: The Musical is the spectacular new musical about discovering who you are and defining who you’re meant to be.\n\nSchool Of Rock: Young Actors\n\nJul 20, 2026 - Aug 8, 2026\n\nAndrew Lloyd Webber’s School of Rock: Young Actors Edition is a dynamic, one-hour version of the musical based on the hit movie."
